	"*** Tarif de base. Le montant est variable en fonction de la complexité du\n\t\t\t\t\t\ttravail.": "*** Starting price. The final amount depends on the complexity of the work.",
	"** Selon la complexité des retouches.": "** Price depends on the complexity of the retouching.",
	"2-5 € / page": "€2–5 / page",
